- Do not use sample Instagram users as real connected accounts.
- Do not simulate successful authentication.
- Do not scrape Instagram or use unofficial login methods.
- Clearly display which features require additional Meta permissions or app review.

Instagram features should include, where permitted:
- Account connection.
